  8. Termination.

  You may not propagate or convey a covered work except as expressly
provided under this License.  Any attempt otherwise to propagate or
convey a covered work is void, and will automatically terminate your
rights under this License.  However, if you cease all violation of
this License, then your license from a particular copyright holder is
